### ==============================================================================
### Cart API Pre-Release Validation Suite (VS Code REST Client)
### Target Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@productId = prod_101

### 01. Pre-Check: Service Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 02. Pre-Check: Get Synthetic Product Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 03. Setup: Reset Cart to Pristine Baseline (0 items)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "default-cart"
}

### 04. Baseline Cart Check: Verify Empty
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### CASE 1: REJECT NEGATIVE QUANTITY (-1)
### Expected: 400 Bad Request, NegativeQuantity error, Cart Unchanged
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": -1
}

### 05. Verify Cart Unchanged after Case 1 (Should be 0 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### CASE 2: REJECT ZERO QUANTITY (0)
### Expected: 400 Bad Request, ZeroQuantity error, Cart Unchanged
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 0
}

### 06. Verify Cart Unchanged after Case 2 (Should be 0 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### CASE 3: REJECT NON-NUMERIC & FRACTIONAL TYPES
### Expected: 400 Bad Request, InvalidQuantityType error, Cart Unchanged
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": "invalid_qty_string"
}

### 07. Case 3B: Reject Fractional Float (1.5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 1.5
}

### 08. Verify Cart Unchanged after Case 3 (Should be 0 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### CASE 4: REJECT QUANTITY EXCEEDING AVAILABLE STOCK
### Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity, InsufficientStock, Cart Unchanged
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 9999
}

### 09. Verify Cart Unchanged after Case 4 (Should be 0 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### POSITIVE CONTROL: POPULATE CART WITH VALID QUANTITY (2)
### Expected: 200 OK, 2 items in cart ($399.98)
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 10. Verify Populated Cart Contains 2 Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### CASE 1B: REJECT NEGATIVE QUANTITY ON POPULATED CART
### Expected: 400 Bad Request, Existing 2 items remain completely intact
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": -5
}

### 11. Verify Populated Cart Intact (Still 2 items, $399.98)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### CASE 4B: REJECT STOCK OVERFLOW ON EXISTING QUANTITY (2 + 14 = 16 > 15)
### Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity, Cart remains at 2 items
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 14
}

### 12. Verify Populated Cart Intact (Still 2 items, $399.98)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart

### ==============================================================================
### FINAL CLEANUP: RESET CART TO PRISTINE BASELINE
### ==============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartId": "default-cart"
}
